WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.520
Here in Rangiora, we've been discussing&nbsp;
the concept of a Civic Precinct.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.880
Now that involves the expansion of the Rangiora&nbsp;
Library here and the main Council building.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:16.320
This would allow the library to&nbsp;
cater for our growing population&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:23.520
and would enable the creation of community spaces&nbsp;
for things like art displays or even a museum.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.840
The upgrade would also better&nbsp;
accommodate staff currently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.720
spread across six different buildings in Rangiora.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.640
The Council's preference is to put&nbsp;
this project on hold until 2028,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.880
now that's going to help keep debt&nbsp;
and rates down in the short term.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.840
Other options include accelerating&nbsp;
the funding and construction of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.560
the combined civic precinct building&nbsp;
or shelving the project altogether.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:01:08.640
Visit waimakariri.govt.nz/letstalk to take&nbsp;
a look at the options and to have your say.

